bind Identify Donor: Donor ID
bind Contact Donor: Donor ID
bind Request Donation: Donor ID
bind Receive Donation: Donor ID, Donation Type, Donation Amount
bind Send Thank You Note: Donor ID
bind Promote Event: Event Type
bind Host Event: Event Type
bind Report Results: Event Type
bind Collect Feedback: Feedback Type
bind Analyze Feedback: Feedback Type
bind Identify Improvement Areas: 
bind Implement Improvements: 
bind Archive Records: 
bind Evaluate Campaign: 
Donor ID: integer between 1 and 10000
Donation Type: Cash, Check, Online Transfer
Donation Amount: float between 10.0 and 100000.0
Event Type: Gala, Auction, Online Campaign
Feedback Type: Positive, Neutral, Negative
Init[Identify Donor] | |
End[Evaluate Campaign] | |
Chain Precedence[Contact Donor, Identify Donor] | |A.Donor ID == T.Donor ID |
Chain Precedence[Request Donation, Contact Donor] | |A.Donor ID == T.Donor ID |
Response[Request Donation, Receive Donation] | |A.Donor ID == T.Donor ID |0,24,d
Response[Receive Donation, Send Thank You Note] | |A.Donor ID == T.Donor ID |0,48,h
Response[Receive Donation, Send Thank You Note] |A.Donation Amount > 100 |A.Donor ID == T.Donor ID |0,48,h
Exactly[Promote Event] | |
Chain Precedence[Host Event, Promote Event] | |A.Event Type == T.Event Type |
Chain Precedence[Report Results, Host Event] | |A.Event Type == T.Event Type |
Existence3[Collect Feedback] | |
Response[Collect Feedback, Analyze Feedback] | |A.Feedback Type == T.Feedback Type |
Response[Analyze Feedback, Identify Improvement Areas] | | |
Response[Identify Improvement Areas, Implement Improvements] | | |0,7,d
Precedence[Archive Records, Report Results] | | |
Precedence[Evaluate Campaign, Archive Records] | | |